# AQP Models

- `aqp_models/` owns custom model pulling, building, training,
  fine-tuning, evaluating, and testing — the qlib-style ML framework,
  Predictor Hub, AlphaBacktestExperiment, walk-forward, finetune
  trainers, every model implementation (tree / linear / sklearn /
  forecast / anomaly / keras / tensorflow / huggingface / SAE / SPM /
  torch zoo), and the custom model-serving slice of `aqp/llm/`
  (vLLM + Ollama).
- `aqp/ml/` is **compatibility shims only** — `aqp/ml/__init__.py`
  re-exports `aqp_models.*` with `DeprecationWarning`. Do not add new
  source files under `aqp/ml/`.
- `aqp/llm/vllm_runner.py` and `aqp/llm/ollama_client.py` are
  **compatibility shims only** — they re-export
  `aqp_models.serving.{vllm,ollama}.*`. Do not add new source there.
- The central LLM gateway (`router_complete`) **stays in the monolith**
  at [`aqp/llm/providers/router.py`](mdc:aqp/llm/providers/router.py)
  per Hard Rule 2 in the root [`AGENTS.md`](mdc:AGENTS.md). Do not move
  the gateway, its memory layer, prompts, cache, or token helpers.
- All ML model lifecycle (train / fit / predict / save / load) goes
  through the model class methods inherited from
  [`BaseModel`](mdc:aqp_models/src/aqp_models/base.py). Tasks
  ([`aqp_models/tasks/`](mdc:aqp_models/tasks/)) and routes
  ([`aqp_models/api/routes/`](mdc:aqp_models/api/routes/)) wrap these
  methods; they never reach into a model's internals.
- All AlphaBacktestExperiment runs go through
  [`AlphaBacktestExperiment.run`](mdc:aqp_models/src/aqp_models/alpha_backtest_experiment.py).
- Workbench flows register via
  [`run_flow(...)`](mdc:aqp_models/src/aqp_models/flows.py); add new
  flows to `_FLOWS_BY_NAME` and `list_flows()` so the webui drawer
  picks them up.
- All models register via `@register("Name", kind="model")` from
  [`aqp.core.registry`](mdc:aqp/core/registry.py) (the central
  registry stays in the monolith).
- All Iceberg writes go through `iceberg_catalog.append_arrow`
  (Hard Rule 3 in the root `AGENTS.md`) with `medallion_layer` +
  `business_metadata` set. Don't call PyIceberg directly.

Validation:

```bash
cd aqp_models
pip install -e .
pytest -ra
ruff check src tests
```
